  m_text: 'Choose Doppelgangers and build a team to defeat the opposing Superior.


    PLAYER
    VS PLAYER - two players on one screen.

    PLAY VS AI - you lead Super Hot,
    the computer leads Super Cold.


    Click a unit to see where it can move and
    attack, then click a tile or an enemy. Use Call to bring a Doppelganger next
    to your Superior. Hover over a tile to read its effect. The Battle log shows
    the latest actions.


    Which side will you fight for? Super Hot or Super Cold?'
